abstract: >-
  An open research agenda on dynamic structural intelligence units,
  perspective masking, differential localization and queries, conditional
  behavioral equivalence, relay composition, structural evolution, and
  verifiable open research relay. Proposed formalisms and hypotheses are
  distinguished from validated findings.
